{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdYpxsSWo3Y6QfbnHffM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The price Thrive Holdings is paying for ADT has two very different headline figures. The companies announced on Thursday that Thrive is acquiring the physical security company for $10 per share, or about $7.6 billion in equity, while ADT puts the deal's total enterprise value at $15.3 billion. Enterprise value generally adds a company's debt and similar obligations to the value of its shares, so roughly $7.7 billion of the deal's total sits outside the equity price.\n\nThe value of the deal depends on what Thrive plans to do with ADT, and that plan has been described only broadly. Thrive Holdings is a holding company spun out of Josh Kushner's Thrive Capital. It says it owns more than 75 companies and aims to hold them long-term and revitalize them with AI. OpenAI is an investor and partner, supplying Thrive's companies with AI models, technology and forward-deployed engineers. According to the press release, ADT \"will form the foundation of Thrive Holdings' smart home security business.\"\n\nWhat has not been announced is any specific AI-powered security product. The companies have said they intend to invest and release new products, without saying what those products will be or when they will arrive. ADT will do this work while Apple launches its own home security line with LG and Schneider Electric and Amazon ships new AI-powered cameras. ADT's existing partnerships with Apple and Google are expected to continue.\n\nAs a result, a deal valued at $15.3 billion has been agreed before any product has been announced to show what OpenAI's models and engineers will add to ADT. Its first releases under Thrive will be the earliest evidence of whether that ownership changes what ADT sells."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":995,"cache_read_input_tokens":3898,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":995},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"611c2f65-ce1a-4fdd-97bb-2cc127751ac9","uuid":"a69ef681-b019-4d4e-966c-b0b8a5f979b7","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:28:49.061Z","request_id":"req_011CgdYpxaaBHfj7tHu4cAwF"}
